From: Prabhsimran Singh <prabhsimrans@nvidia.com>
Subject: ggml-cuda: fuse LayerNorm with row-vector scale and bias

Fuses GGML_OP_NORM + MUL (+ ADD) when gamma/beta are contiguous ne0-length
row vectors, the affine LayerNorm used throughout FastConformer.

Upstream: candidate. CUDA lacks NORM+MUL+ADD fusion while Metal and OpenCL
have it; an upstream version should reuse the rms_norm broadcast machinery
and add row-vector test cases.

